    source_manifest['adaptations']['pyasm/search/widget_db_config.py'] = '0.54 complete original backend WidgetDbConfig/WidgetDbConfigCache module adopted; XML views, element/display options, imports, edits, config creation/commit and priority merging retained. Old Python widget rendering, executable Mako and default renderer views explicitly guarded. Plain/attribute views initialized correctly. Original element movement AttributeError/destructive removal, incorrect insert argument order, widget-key argument order, NULL-priority sorting, overwritten fallback attributes/action and cross-project lookup cache collisions fixed. Class strings remain configuration data. Unchanged package script compared with actual original; movement and stale trigger defects have separate source/native expectations.'
