    source_manifest['adaptations']['pyasm/biz/prod_setting.py'] += ' 0.54 original create/add_value_by_key writes use shared native SObject/Command/security/journal; admin/sthpw create no-op retained. Captured source upgrade removes obsolete unique-key constraint, allowing equal keys scoped to different search types.'
    source_manifest['adaptations']['config_upgrade.json'] = '0.54 original empty shipped config/widget_config, prod_setting, trigger and client_trigger registry/tables, source widget priority/title/description columns and removal of obsolete prod_setting unique-key constraint. System bootstrap/upgrade, new project construction and installer upgrade of existing projects on SQLite/PostgreSQL; no user rows or default renderer data.'
    source_manifest['adaptations']['pyasm/search/database_impl.py'] += ' 0.54 installer/new-project config upgrade is transactional. SQLite reuses table rebuild preserving rows, declared indexes/triggers and AUTOINCREMENT; PostgreSQL drops the source named constraint. Durable schema undo remains unported.'
    source_manifest['adaptations']['pyasm/common/lxml_wrapper.py'] += ' 0.54 comments preserved and excluded from element XPath/children, original create_text_element/get_parent/replace_child/insert_before/after signatures adopted on stdlib parent links. import_node returns a detached copy instead of original unintended root mutation/None. CDATA normalized to text by default, preservation mode still guarded.'
    source_manifest['adaptations']['pyasm/search/search.py'] += ' 0.54 widget/prod_setting/trigger/client_trigger persistence and original change events use shared core. Writes/deletes clear affected config caches across project prefixes, XML cache and derived trigger event maps. Rollback clears the same caches. No new renderer or parallel configuration persistence.'
    source_manifest['adaptations']['pyasm/command/trigger.py'] += ' 0.54 DB trigger invalidation also removes derived event caches; original left stale handlers in the same request. Ordinary and integral registrations preserved. Project.switch clears derived definitions to prevent a previous project handler leaking.'
    source_manifest['adaptations']['pyasm/biz/project.py'] += ' 0.54 switching project invalidates DB-derived trigger caches while preserving static/integral registrations.'
    source_manifest['adaptations']['pyasm/search/transaction.py'] += ' 0.54 rollback invalidates backend config and trigger caches for written config objects.'
    source_manifest['adaptations']['pyasm/search/sql.py'] += ' 0.54 restores original optional database=None argument for clear_table_cache; native metadata invalidation remains shared across resources.'
    source_manifest['sources']['src/pyasm/biz/custom_property.py'] = {'sha256': hashlib.sha256((legacy / 'src/pyasm/biz/custom_property.py').read_bytes()).hexdigest()}
    source_manifest['adaptations']['pyasm/biz/custom_property.py'] = '0.55 original class, SEARCH_TYPE and delete(log=False) contract preserved; metadata-only delete leaves the column. log=True authorizes first, resolves the actual target DbResource and journals/drop the column in the current Command. Fixes original DbContainer.get(database-string) AssertionError, avoids project-code/physical-database assumption and swallowed DDL failure. Original failure asserted separately; native success, authorization, dependent-view failure and row/DDL rollback checked on both vendors. Durable schema undo/redo remains unported.'
    source_manifest['adaptations']['config_upgrade.json'] += ' 0.55 adds original config/pipeline, custom_property, ingest_rule, ingest_session and translation. Pipeline registry receives original upgrade_v4_1_0_b02_002 ProjectPipeline class update; custom_property empty shipped system DDL also installed per project. Ingest/translation definitions are stored data, not an ingest engine or frontend translation bridge.'
    source_manifest['adaptations']['pyasm/biz/pipeline.py'] += ' 0.55 original ProjectPipeline.get_defaults copied; project pipeline reads/defaults/update_dependencies use shared Pipeline/Process/SObject paths. Explicit process update remains original contract; renderer/process-template and nested-graph limits unchanged.'
    source_manifest['adaptations']['pyasm/search/search.py'] += ' 0.55 project pipeline/custom_property/ingest/translation writes use shared admin transaction, journal and events. Project pipeline commit refreshes parsed XML and invalidates project identity/XML/status caches; delete and rollback clear the same config caches.'
    source_manifest['adaptations']['pyasm/search/transaction.py'] += ' 0.55 AlterTableUndo.log_drop records the original alter/drop/type fields after resource authorization and metadata validation, without assuming physical DB name is a project code.'
    source_manifest['adaptations']['pyasm/search/sql.py'] += ' 0.55 native drop_column uses quoted identifiers and existing active admin schema boundary; metadata invalidated after successful DDL.'
    source_manifest['adaptations']['tactic_stream/server/startup.py'] += ' 0.55.1 explicitly selects stdlib SelectorEventLoop for monitor-passed Windows listener sockets. Parent already owns process spawning, so Uvicorn otherwise selects single-process Proactor and competing IOCP registration fails with WinError 87. Standalone sockets=None and Linux auto loop remain unchanged. Actual HTTP served by both shared-port workers and replacement worker verified on Windows.'
    source_manifest['sources']['src/pyasm/search/sql_dumper.py'] = {'sha256': hashlib.sha256((legacy / 'src/pyasm/search/sql_dumper.py').read_bytes()).hexdigest()}
    source_manifest['adaptations']['pyasm/search/sql_dumper.py'] = '0.56 original TableSchemaDumper/TableDataDumper classes and selected public setters/SPT signatures retained; portable CreateTable/SearchType entries, sorted columns, include_id/ignore/replace/skip-invalid and relative directory options. Original schema traversal retained on native resource/constraint metadata and safe repr literals. String triple-quote corruption, system-object project DB inference, empty selection and unclosed schema output fixed; constructor delimiter honored. SPT files append through active persisted-admin FileUndo with rollback of replaced content. SQLite/PostgreSQL id/columns/NOT NULL/UNIQUE supported; source omits column defaults/CHECK/nonunique indexes, not a full database backup. SQL views/non-id primary keys/FK/exclusion/partial/expression/NULLS NOT DISTINCT unique indexes fail explicitly. Raw SQL data dumps and deprecated Oracle/MSSQL dump paths remain unported. Unchanged export body compared with actual original; intentional quote/empty/file-rollback differences asserted separately.'
    source_manifest['adaptations']['tactic/command/plugin.py'] += ' 0.56 original PluginCreator handle_data/dump_sobject/ignore validation/search_type/Python validation and Tools export entry points retained, shared native dumper selection avoids duplicate implementation. Native creator executes original manifest algorithm, bounded output/ZIP and include handling, final manifest registration and transactional file journal. Fixes original versioned ZIP path mismatch, stale registered manifest and include XML context; unsupported nodes/nested export fail rather than silent success. Namespaced codes and manifest version supported; symlinks/traversal/recursive includes refused. Both native vendors export/install schemas, rows, settings, exact scripts and pipeline tokens into another project, preserve uniqueness/nullability and explicit IDs, deny nonadmin before writes, restore old files/ZIP after late failure. No UI exporter or new transport method.'
    source_manifest['adaptations']['pyasm/search/database_impl.py'] += ' 0.56 original get_constraints signature on native catalogs: SQLite PRAGMA indexes/keys and PostgreSQL schema-scoped ordered catalog columns, including standalone unique indexes; NOT NULL catalog rows are represented by column metadata. No regex parsing of quoted index SQL, swallowed errors or cross-schema leakage.'
    source_manifest['adaptations']['pyasm/search/sql.py'] += ' 0.56 CreateTable retains NOT NULL for generic type names such as integer, rather than losing it in the source fallback branch; checked by actual schema export/reinstall.'
    source_manifest['adaptations']['pyasm/search/search.py'] += ' 0.56 normalizes the local empty/string new ID to integer -1 before insertion as well as the object new_id; PostgreSQL sequence read now runs for schema objects created without an ID. SQLite last_row_id previously hid this native defect.'
    source_manifest['adaptations']['pyasm/common/lxml_wrapper.py'] += ' 0.56 original get_first_child signature/element-child behavior added for PluginCreator data-node insertion.'
    source_manifest['adaptations']['tactic/command/plugin.py'] += ' 0.57 original PluginUninstaller execute/handle_nodes/remove_sobjects/nested/include/Python undo and deregistration algorithms adopted; public signatures preserved. Reversed manifest, shared registry/schema definitions and package files retained. Native admin/Command boundary before effects, bounded paths, recursive include/plugin refusal and unsupported node guard. Object/DDL exceptions propagate rather than original swallowed partial deactivation. Recursive include traversal defers deregistration to the outer handle_nodes, while a direct public handle_nodes still deregisters. Nested absolute mode follows installer; includes validate/restore XML. PluginTools.remove_search_type backs up remaining retired/live rows with explicit IDs/NULLs, then native DropTable; reinstall imports backup and repairs sequence before deleting that backup. Source ID-loss and swallowed-delete behavior compared separately with actual original. Pipeline code selection remaps the same prefix as import; successful imports clear force_insert so cached restored objects update normally. Uninstall/reinstall, late DDL/file rollback, admin refusal, dependent view failure and original execute_cmd on both vendors; nested package/real undo file rollback and recursion guards checked. System/config table definitions and ZIP-based uninstall remain explicitly guarded; installed directory/code is supported.'
    source_manifest['adaptations']['pyasm/search/sql.py'] += ' 0.57 original DropTable class/Base inheritance, constructor/get_statement/commit names adapted to native resource authorization and transactional DDL/schema cache. Quoted schema/table identifiers, encoded cache file components, shared table drop journal and row-cache invalidation; no early commit or CASCADE. Immediate Command rollback restores SQL and files; durable schema undo remains unported. Sql.clear_results now releases its own result reference instead of nulling a list already returned to a caller, fixing nested metadata iteration; unchanged source/native script asserts this intentional correction.'
    source_manifest['adaptations']['pyasm/search/database_impl.py'] += ' 0.57 vendor table-drop preparation holds SQLite BEGIN IMMEDIATE or PostgreSQL ACCESS EXCLUSIVE through backup/DROP. PostgreSQL native dependencies reject DROP. SQLite refuses incoming foreign keys and compiles views with a temporary delegating SQLITE_READ authorizer to discover real/nested dependencies; EXPLAIN executes no view data/body, existing authorization is restored in finally. No SQL regex dependency parser and no vendor branches in domain modules.'
    source_manifest['adaptations']['pyasm/search/sql_dumper.py'] += ' 0.57 emits explicit None with allow_none=True rather than omitting NULLs; data backups retain NULL even where a target default could otherwise replace it. IDs kept for uninstall backups. Schema export remains the documented portable subset, not a full DB backup.'
    source_manifest['adaptations']['pyasm/security/authenticator.py'] += ' 0.58 validate uses original Ticket expiry and Login identity/retirement/UPN lookup without group discovery; bind_security rechecks the ticket and constructs full persisted rights once in the actual user/project request context. Guest refusal and context isolation retained; no cross-request identity/group cache.'
    source_manifest['adaptations']['pyasm/search/storage.py'] += ' 0.58 request Container caches search-type/resource/table resolution by owned Store, exact search type and project; definitions returned as copies. Explicit Store writes invalidate metadata; different Store instances do not share cached resolutions.'
    source_manifest['adaptations']['pyasm/search/search.py'] += ' 0.58 restores original request-scoped SearchType column metadata reuse, keyed by project and search type. Project switches, raw metadata writes, DDL and rollback verified; no global schema cache.'
    source_manifest['adaptations']['pyasm/search/sql.py'] += ' 0.58 SQL writes clear cached registry/routing/column metadata, schema invalidation includes Store resolution, rollback/savepoint rollback clears schema caches. A cached Sql acquired before Command now registers itself with the active transaction before writes, preventing accidental early DDL commits outside its rollback.'
    source_manifest['adaptations']['tactic/command/create_project_cmd.py'] += ' 0.58 original CopyProjectFromTemplateCmd delegates existing kwargs to ProjectTemplateInstallerCmd; removes unused local bindings only. Original execute signature/import path retained; ZIP copy/reinstallation verified on SQLite/PostgreSQL.'
    source_manifest['adaptations']['tactic/command/project_template_cmd.py'] += ' 0.58 original ProjectTemplateCheckCmd and helper signatures copied; fixes inverted project-type equality and search-type prefix conditions, Seach typo and nonexistent sthpw/search_type registry. Persisted admin/Command required for execute; absent/retired projects and empty prefixes fail explicitly. Same script executed against original runtime with separate source bug expectations and both native vendors. Whole-project template export/creation remains unported.'
    source_manifest['adaptations']['tactic/command/project_template_cmd.py'] += ' 0.59 whole original ProjectTemplateCreatorCmd execute/export_template/get_zip_path and manifest algorithm copied, connected to native PluginCreator without a parallel format. Persisted admin/Command preflight and absent/retired project guard. Source namespace selection loses own-project types when project_type differs; native selection includes both namespaces. Sequence floors read without nextval/setval side effects; original SQLite exported -1. Same unchanged export body compared with actual original, including notification data and intentional namespace/floor/file-rollback differences. Versioned native ZIP exported then installed into a fresh project on SQLite/PostgreSQL, preserving config scripts/widgets/settings, groups/access rules, pipeline and notification metadata. Original templates contain definitions/config, not asset rows/files. Updater, move, forced DB, non-simple base schemas, UI and portable-schema/durable undo limits remain.'
    source_manifest['adaptations']['pyasm/search/database_impl.py'] += ' 0.59 vendor get_table_sequence_value reads MAX(id) and persisted floor without changing it; SQLite sqlite_sequence/AUTOINCREMENT and PostgreSQL last_value/is_called. SQLite ensure_table_sequence preserves imported floors including deleted high IDs, validates admin/schema write and uses transactional sqlite_sequence writes. PostgreSQL existing ALTER RESTART remains transactional. Both vendors checked for unchanged export floor, imported next ID and late floor rollback.'
    source_manifest['adaptations']['pyasm/search/search.py'] += ' 0.59 enables original sthpw/notification metadata through the shared administrator business write boundary; insert/update/delete clear notification definition and event caches. No email dispatch implementation.'
    source_manifest['adaptations']['pyasm/command/trigger.py'] += ' 0.59 clear_db_cache also clears NOTIFICATION_KEY and NOTIFICATION_EVENT_KEY; notification edits/imports/project switches cannot reuse earlier definitions in the same request. Email preflight still fails explicitly.'
    source_manifest['adaptations']['pyasm/prod/service/api_xmlrpc.py'] += ' 0.60 adopts 13 public method signatures/bodies: subscribe/unsubscribe, interaction writes/count, widget settings, plugin directory, upload cleanup, fast_query and four XML configuration methods. Shared persisted-admin/Command/SObject/FileUndo boundary. Fixes subscription project isolation, personal config login selection, default separator condition, cross-document node import, caller display_options mutation and named-view root initialization. XML options retain single escaping rather than source double-escaped ampersands. Errors propagate instead of source UI ExceptionWdg success envelopes. Fast query remains opt-in/admin and preserves Security rather than replacing it with a blank object that loses project access. Renderer, unsupported base/view modes, durable transactions and ExceptionLog persistence remain guarded/unported. Same script compared with actual original runtime and both native vendors; source defects have separate expectations.'
    source_manifest['adaptations']['pyasm/web/widget.py'] = '0.60 whole original WidgetSettings persistent class and public signatures, native Environment/registered SearchType and request cache; no DATABASE/form/CMS fallback. Cache keyed by project/login and invalidated by settings writes/delete/rollback. Deprecated form-backed reads fail explicitly.'
    source_manifest['adaptations']['pyasm/biz/subscription.py'] = '0.60 whole original Subscription class and signatures; lookup/create/unsubscribe additionally scope message keys to current project, fixing cross-project collisions. No notification dispatcher introduced.'
    source_manifest['adaptations']['pyasm/search/search.py'] += ' 0.60 subscription/interaction/wdg_settings join existing business write/trigger/journal paths; settings caches invalidated on mutations and rollback. Captured source tables and registry upgrade existing and fresh SQLite/PostgreSQL installs.'
    source_manifest['adaptations']['pyasm/common/common.py'] += ' 0.60 original order-preserving get_unique_list and upper-exclusive randint signatures adopted; stdlib secrets replaces SystemRandom implementation.'
    source_manifest['adaptations']['pyasm/common/environment.py'] += ' 0.60 private ticket directory resolution can avoid creating a missing upload directory; clear_upload_dir uses existing FileUndo authorization and rollback, leaves other tickets untouched.'
    source_manifest['adaptations']['tactic/command/project_template_cmd.py'] += ' 0.60 original ProjectTemplateUpdaterCmd is empty; import/class/execute name provided but explicit UnsupportedContract directs callers to ProjectTemplateInstallerCmd(new_project=False). No fabricated update algorithm or successful no-op.'
    source_manifest['adaptations']['tactic/core/sidebar_config.py'] = '0.60 selected default/definition XML resolution algorithm in existing Api with captured simple/admin/DEFAULT/children metadata; no legacy renderer dependency. License navigation/manager elements excluded during capture; original XML copyright retained. Unsupported base types fail explicitly.'
    source_manifest['adaptations']['tactic/command/queue.py'] = '0.61 whole original Queue class/get_next_job/add signatures and pending conditional claim algorithm; no JobTask/scheduler/process runner adopted. Registered system queue only, persisted-admin active Command preflight before any claim, quoted identifiers, source schema/registry/column migrations/state index automatically installed on both vendors. Successful claim clears stale queue identity cache and preserves explicit priority zero instead of source 9999. Shared SObject writes/triggers and original queue journal exclusions retained. Same script compared with actual source (source returned cached pending), rollback and two simultaneous consumers tested on SQLite/PostgreSQL; no queue executor/crash recovery claim.'
    source_manifest['adaptations']['pyasm/prod/service/api_xmlrpc.py'] += ' 0.61 nine public methods: generate_ticket (random key, not a login ticket), administrator ticket/connection diagnostics, original test_error NameError, execute_class_method through persisted-admin trusted-Python/Command guard, add_queue_item, checkout, full snapshot XML and documentation aliases. Native connection stats are request-local; no legacy global connection pool. Checkout calls Trigger.call with correct caller/event/output and project-specific event scoping, fixing source missing checkout callback. Levels remain guarded; legacy renderers, persistent resumed API transactions, undo/redo, sync replay and job execution still unfinished.'
    source_manifest['adaptations']['pyasm/common/common.py'] += ' 0.61 original create_from_method signature/zero-argument constructor semantics; existing trusted class resolver plus getattr replaces eval. Invalid/private method names rejected before construction.'
    source_manifest['adaptations']['pyasm/common/environment.py'] += ' 0.61 original get_install_dir accessor and get_base_url classmethod/Url result, with request-local ASGI origin and configured install/base_url when available; batch hostname/protocol fallback retained.'
    source_manifest['adaptations']['pyasm/web/widget.py'] += ' 0.61 whole headless Url class and original public signatures adopted; stdlib urllib.parse replaces Python 2 urlparse/basestring. urlencode(doseq=True) fixes original list-option mutation and wrong repeated list encoding; WebState renderer guard retained.'
    source_manifest['adaptations']['pyasm/biz/snapshot.py'] += ' 0.61 original get_full_snapshot_xml enabled on copied XML rather than shared cache; existing SnapshotBuilder/File/paths used. Enrich actual file node directly instead of building an XPath from its filename, fixing source XmlException for apostrophes; missing File raises explicitly. No repository/file effects.'
    source_manifest['adaptations']['pyasm/biz/dir_naming.py'] += ' 0.61 original remote URL base algorithm enabled with current Environment/ASGI origin; existing http alias and directory naming paths reused, without a legacy web renderer.'
    source_manifest['adaptations']['pyasm/search/search.py'] += ' 0.61 original deprecated add_limit alias, queue business/trigger authorization; original non-undo queue journal exclusions unchanged.'
    source_manifest['adaptations']['doc/alias.json'] = '0.61 original documentation aliases packaged for native install_dir fallback; commercial license installation alias excluded. Links remain original data, no documentation website or renderer introduced.'
    source_manifest['adaptations']['tactic/command/queue.py'] += ' 0.62 JobTask public class/signatures and original serial three-attempt repeat algorithm adapted to owned short Command/Batch contexts. Claim and host assignment commit together; command effects and completion share Transaction (existing multi-database partial commit limitation remains). Retry stops for TacticException, UnsupportedContract and PartialCommitException. Runs as persisted submitter/project, renews expired internal service credentials while rechecking account retirement, checks administrator script rights before command construction. Source JobTask lost kwargs, max-completed off-by-one, current-PID restart cleanup, unsafe transaction clearing and unreachable fork branches removed/fixed. Monitor joins/kills only owned process before resetting its exact host:PID locked rows; does not reset foreign locks. Cancellation is cooperative between attempts, not interruption of running Python. QueueTest imported with an explicit test failure replacing source undefined name. Local-only sync policy follows native API; no remote transaction replay or interval queue semantics. Source module run_batch/CLI fork helper not migrated. Actual original success/permanent-failure script compared unchanged; retry/rollback/scheduler/owner recovery verified on SQLite/PostgreSQL and real hung Windows worker.'
    source_manifest['adaptations']['tactic/command/scheduler.py'] = '0.62 original Scheduler/SchedulerTask/SchedulerTaskCmd public signatures and task mapping adopted. Preserves once/interval/daily/weekly scheduling, ticket/user/project, Workflow and Command. Fixes weekly scalar tuple/typo, missing single task registration, missing user assignment, Python 3.14 daemon API, native held Batch and captured owned Store in threads. Source example add_sobject fails explicitly; forked/multi-site/persistent scheduler definitions unported. Stop cancels future scheduling but does not interrupt an already running task. Local-only transaction synchronization matches native API.'
    source_manifest['adaptations']['tactic/command/kronos.py'] = '0.62 entire original MIT Kronos module copied, including source copyright/docstring. Modern stdlib sched nonblocking run and Event wakeups avoid five-second idle delay; RLock guards task metadata, public queue cancellation replaces unsafe private queue mutation, cancelled intervals do not resurrect. Python 3.14 Thread.daemon replaces removed setDaemon. Original cron/dateutil/day/month scheduling algorithms retained; runtime wrapper guards forked mode.'
    source_manifest['adaptations']['tactic_stream/server/monitor.py'] += ' 0.62 optional services/enable tactic|queue starts one dedicated owned queue process alongside configured web workers. Same shared stop/heartbeat supervision, shutdown deadline and restart backoff; only dead owned queue host:PID locks recovered. Queue logs rotate in original data temp/log/queue.log. Existing configurations opt in, fresh default includes queue. Entire monitor or machine crash recovery and durable exception/debug logs remain unfinished.'
    source_manifest['adaptations']['pyasm/search/exception_log.py'] = '0.63 original ExceptionLog class/public signatures and traceback normalization, login/class/message/stack_trace fields. Source global rollback removed; native helper commits diagnostic rows in an owned request/Command/SQL connection with record/sync disabled and persisted administrator checks. Original error is retained when diagnostic persistence fails; log_exception=False prevents recursion. Manual logging during an active system writer and email notifications fail explicitly. Exception table keeps its source generic SObject registry and no code column. No fabricated asynchronous success.'
    source_manifest['adaptations']['pyasm/biz/debug_log.py'] = '0.63 whole source DebugLog class/public signatures/constants, same independent diagnostic writer as ExceptionLog. Standalone/admin API logging and project-only write transactions supported; active system writer refused equally on SQLite/PostgreSQL. Returned SObject is already durable. ValueError replaces optimizable assert for invalid log levels; no forced transaction sharing or caller record flag mutation. Same unchanged standalone/commit/API/rollback contract compared with actual original: source reports a DebugLog ID but loses the row during outer rollback; native independent row survives, with a separate source-bug expectation.'
    source_manifest['adaptations']['pyasm/command/command.py'] += ' 0.63 automatic ExceptionLog after top-level rollback and failed commit rollback. Nested failures log once at top level; explicit log_exception=False suppresses diagnostics. Diagnostic failure logs to standard server logger and never masks the original command error. Cancellation/KeyboardInterrupt remain unlogged.'
    source_manifest['adaptations']['pyasm/search/search.py'] += ' 0.63 source exception/debug log definitions join native administrator SObject persistence; diagnostic writer intentionally suppresses triggers/undo journal and uses independent connection.'
    source_manifest['adaptations']['pyasm/prod/service/api_xmlrpc.py'] += ' 0.63 original log API signature/DebugLog call/True result. Admin-only native transport/local SDK; independent durable system log write, active-system-writer contract guarded.'
    source_manifest['adaptations']['pyasm/search/storage.py'] += ' 0.63 performance correction: SQLite read-only connections are reused within one owned RequestContext and closed on normal/exceptional exit. No cross-request connection, identity or ACL cache; active Command/Sql reads still borrow the transaction connection.'
    source_manifest['adaptations']['pyasm/search/search.py'] += ' 0.63 performance correction: Search constructor uses existing SearchType column metadata cache instead of repeating Store.columns reads. Existing write/DDL/rollback/project cache invalidation retained; request context owns and closes its read-only SQLite connections.'
    source_manifest['adaptations']['pyasm/common/system.py'] = '0.63 whole original module copied unchanged, including System/_System, filesystem helpers, configured system_class and memory_usage. Original Windows/Darwin zero RSS values retained; Linux reads actual /proc/self/status.'
    source_manifest['adaptations']['pyasm/prod/service/api_xmlrpc.py'] += ' 0.63 original get_simple_cmd print_primary_info/print_secondary_info blocks extracted. Only context/print destination adapted to an atomic standard-logging block; original request/thread counter format, timestamp, function repr, ticket/argument array, duration and RSS increment. Password/payload secret redaction retained, ticket shown by explicit user request. Native implementation class now ApiXMLRPC with Api alias; Duration starts after authenticated/project initialization like source, Total Duration separately reports the entire native dispatch. No additional command/formatting wrapper.'
    source_manifest['adaptations']['pyasm/security/authenticator.py'] += ' 0.63 persisted identity preflight reads only ticket expiry and login/UPN/retirement with bound vendor parameters, rather than building redundant full SObjects. Full Security.login_with_ticket rechecks persisted ticket/account/groups in the actual project context. Shared expiry rule with Ticket, same UPN/case-insensitive/guest refusal; no session identity/ACL cache.'
    source_manifest['adaptations']['pyasm/security/security.py'] += ' 0.63 a fresh unauthenticated AccessManager starts was_admin=False to prevent Sudo.set_up from duplicating the explicit persisted group discovery in _do_login. Same groups/defaults/ACLs, including Source cyclic-group bug expectations. Ticket expiry uses one shared helper, stdlib parsing only for canonical database timestamps and original dateutil fallback otherwise.'
    source_manifest['adaptations']['pyasm/common/config.py'] += ' 0.63 request-local resolved config path with environment override/reload checks; one immutable parsed file snapshot reused only when mtime_ns/size match, deep-copied for each request. Unsaved edits remain private; new requests detect disk changes, explicit reload rereads the file. No shared mutable Config/ACL state.'
    source_manifest['adaptations']['pyasm/search/storage.py'] += ' 0.63 removes duplicate SQLite path validation after DbResource construction; request-local validated canonical database paths pin the endpoint and retain directory escape checks. Readers and SQL still close on request exit.'
    source_manifest['adaptations']['pyasm/search/search.py'] += ' 0.63 removes duplicate per-row Store.resolve after the original trusted fast_data branch, matching the source constructor. Ordinary construction/search and write boundaries retain resource resolution.'
    source_manifest['adaptations']['pyasm/common/spt_date.py'] += ' 0.63 stdlib ISO parsing for canonical database timestamp strings; original timezone conversion and dateutil parsing for all other strings retained.'
    source_manifest['adaptations']['pyasm/search/search.py'] += ' 0.63 measured audit: trusted class resolution is reused only inside one fast_data result batch. Public factory signature, custom constructor and broad original fallback retained; fresh batches re-resolve classes and observe module/registry changes.'
    source_manifest['adaptations']['pyasm/common/spt_date.py'] += ' 0.63 measured audit: ordinary fold=0 naive GMT datetimes already equal the original final value, so return them directly; subclasses, fold=1, aware/local/date-only paths retain the original conversion and are compared against the actual source method.'
    source_manifest['adaptations']['tactic_stream/server/api.py'] = 'Native transports: a dedicated JSON API instance returns query dictionaries/lists directly, avoiding repr/literal_eval. Default XML-RPC preserves the original Python-string query envelope and public signature; local SDK returns native values. Both transports use the same per-request authentication, ACL/Command paths; concurrent transport parity verified.'
    source_manifest['adaptations']['pyasm/widget/widget_config.py'] = '0.64 original tactic/core/widget_config module copied to native pyasm/widget location. WidgetConfig/WidgetConfigView XML data, precedence and metadata methods preserved; original HTML renderer entry points explicitly unsupported. Original prototype edit resolver replaced by working main resolver with EditWdg layout. Source use_cache=False now bypasses the request object cache; configs list is privately owned; DOM importNode fixed to the existing detached Xml.import_node. Source config2 XML metadata shipped as package resources; obsolete sites lookup uses owned data directory; project base defaults reuse the existing original XML snapshot. Commercial license elements removed from login metadata; legacy unittest XML not shipped. Renderer-inferred default handlers remain unported.'
    source_manifest['adaptations']['tactic/ui/common/widget_class_handler.py'] = '0.64 whole original WidgetClassHandler/TableElementClassHandler metadata dictionaries and methods; only unnecessary tacticenv startup import removed. Class paths remain server data; no HTML renderer imported or instantiated.'
    source_manifest['adaptations']['pyasm/search/sobject_default_config.py'] = '0.64 whole original column/basic view generator; only column and nullability introspection adapted to the shared SearchType/vendor metadata. No browser widgets instantiated.'
    source_manifest['adaptations']['pyasm/common/lxml_wrapper.py'] += ' 0.64 read_file and constructor file_path accept trusted UTF-8 XML through the same DTD/entity checks and clear XPath cache; file trees never shared globally. Original recursive option extraction copied with classmethod syntax and Python 3 string type. UTF-16 file loading remains unported.'
    source_manifest['adaptations']['pyasm/biz/project.py'] += ' 0.64 original namespace/multi-project get_search_types selection and has_table introduced; table existence uses vendor DatabaseImpl, not a broad swallowed database exception. No ineffective search_types cache across include flags.'
